      "type": "text",
      "text": "Effective resuscitation is as much about team dynamics as it is about medical knowledge. The 2025 AHA Guidelines significantly elevate human factors as a first-class topic in ACLS. Studies demonstrate that teams w defined roles, clear communication, & mutual respect achieve better compression fractions, faster defib times, & improved pt survival."
     }
